<row><cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">1.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">  August   </cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1"><hi rendition="#aq">Philadelphia</hi>,</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">             <hi rendition="#aq">H. W. Greve,</hi>           </cell>         </row>        <lb/>
<row><cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">1.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">Septbr.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1"><hi rendition="#aq">Bremen</hi>,</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">             <hi rendition="#aq">B. D. Köper,</hi>           </cell>         </row>        <lb/>
<row><cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">1.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">Octbr.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1"><hi rendition="#aq">Vesta</hi>,</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">             <hi rendition="#aq">Diedr. Klamp,</hi>           </cell>         </row>        <lb/>
<row><cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">1.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">Novbr.</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1"><hi rendition="#aq">Louise Marie</hi>,</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">-</cell>           <cell rows="1" cols="1">             <hi rendition="#aq">C. Wencke.</hi>           </cell>         </row>       </table>      <lb/>
<p>Diese Schiffe haben vorzügliche Gelegenheiten für Passagiere in ihren<lb/>
elegant und bequem eingerichteten, mit Schlafkammern versehenen Cajüten<lb/>
und hohen geräumigen Zwischendecken, und halte ich denselben, so wie den<lb/>
Herren Verladern von Frachtgütern diese Schiffe bestens empfohlen.   </p><lb/>
